## Third-party notices / 第三方说明

- This project links against **PySide6 (Qt for Python)**, which is licensed under
  the **LGPL v3** (see https://www.qt.io/licensing/). It is used as an
  unmodified, dynamically linked library. Users may replace the PySide6/Qt
  libraries with their own compatible builds.
  （本项目使用 PySide6，采用 LGPL v3 授权，未修改并以动态链接方式使用。）
- This project is a **front-end** for [scrcpy](https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy)
  (Apache-2.0) and **adb** (Android platform-tools). Those programs are **not**
  bundled or redistributed here; users install them separately.
  （本项目不打包、不再分发 scrcpy 与 adb，需用户自行安装。）
